WEBVTT

00:08.920 --> 00:10.130
Saku-chan, Saku-chan!

00:10.130 --> 00:11.740
Check this out!

00:12.060 --> 00:15.200
My penis is so big, I can give myself a blowjob!

00:19.130 --> 00:24.800
You! I'm trying so hard to lighten the mood, and you ignore me!

00:24.800 --> 00:27.130
Look! I said look at me! And tell me your opinion!

00:27.840 --> 00:32.090
Azazel-san, I may not look like it, but I am a very quick learner.

00:33.080 --> 00:36.980
In fact, right now I'm learning a spell that will make you suffer.

00:38.150 --> 00:39.950
Want to try it out?

00:41.430 --> 00:42.650
Sorry for disturbing you...

00:45.810 --> 00:48.310
Guess who's here!

00:52.160 --> 00:56.250
What the hell is wrong with her? She can use the grimoire now?

00:56.250 --> 01:00.300
Shit, shit, shit, shit... She's starting to act like Akutabe-han now!

01:01.760 --> 01:06.650
This is BAD, I can't do serious work all the time!{timer: the "this is bad" goes to the earlier (untimed) AKAAAN}

01:06.650 --> 01:10.200
I want to quit... I want to quit once and for all...

01:16.220 --> 01:20.220
<b>The Seiya Arc</b>

01:20.850 --> 01:23.430
I have a job for you.

01:23.780 --> 01:26.930
Only the two of us? What about you?

01:26.930 --> 01:28.840
I won't be involved this time.

01:28.840 --> 01:31.230
I'm going to be gone for a few days.

01:31.230 --> 01:33.560
You just wanna party by yourself!

01:33.560 --> 01:35.320
It's a job, you pig!

01:35.320 --> 01:39.410
I don't want to! Azazel-san won't listen anyway...

01:39.410 --> 01:40.300
He'll just get in the way.

01:40.300 --> 01:41.030
Don't worry.

01:41.650 --> 01:47.680
Demons can't use their powers to hurt the person who contracted them.

01:47.680 --> 01:50.330
That's right! But I can still harass you all I want!

01:50.620 --> 01:52.910
I know, but I'm still kind of worried...

01:52.910 --> 01:54.380
I see. Such a shame.

01:55.560 --> 02:00.050
Had you succeeded, this reward money would have been yours.

02:01.580 --> 02:05.020
Azazel-san! Move it! The client is waiting!

02:05.370 --> 02:06.590
I want to break up with a guy...

02:06.590 --> 02:08.290
WHAT THE FLYING FUCK IS THAT?!{I LOLD SO HARD}

02:08.290 --> 02:10.840
Saku-chan! She's got a pile of shit on her head!

02:10.840 --> 02:11.990
And it's spilling over!

02:11.990 --> 02:16.120
Saori-san, what kind of man is he?

02:15.550 --> 02:18.150
What's wrong with you?! How can you look at that with a straight face?!

02:18.480 --> 02:21.960
He's a worthless idiot. Completely caught up in his own delusions. Just your average lech.

02:21.960 --> 02:23.910
Look who's talking!

02:23.910 --> 02:26.160
I need to mail a shot of this to Bee. He'll get a kick out of it.

02:26.590 --> 02:31.150
This is awesome! No matter how long you look at it, it still packs a punch!

02:31.150 --> 02:33.120
So, what exactly does the job entail?

02:33.430 --> 02:36.520
It's all here. You <i>can</i> read right?

02:36.320 --> 02:37.590
Check this out, eh?

02:36.520 --> 02:37.590
Got it.

02:44.190 --> 02:50.130
So that's why Akutabe-san said he can't go. The job is in a ladies-only host club!

02:50.130 --> 02:51.340
Shit!

02:51.920 --> 02:53.400
Zup yo.

02:53.400 --> 02:55.390
Thanks for choosing me yo.

02:55.390 --> 02:57.060
I'm Sei yo.

02:57.060 --> 02:57.480
Nice to meet you.

02:58.190 --> 03:01.660
Something's missing today...

03:02.620 --> 03:05.450
Does he have a single shred of motivation for this job?

03:06.010 --> 03:07.060
That a dog o somethin'?

03:07.720 --> 03:08.550
Huh?

03:08.550 --> 03:10.510
Is that a dog?

03:11.980 --> 03:13.290
I'm no dog...

03:12.870 --> 03:16.970
You're not supposed to talk if someone sees you!

03:16.970 --> 03:18.750
Oh dat thing is talkin'...

03:19.070 --> 03:23.090
If he can see me, he knows I'm a demon.

03:23.090 --> 03:24.920
What's wrong with you?!

03:26.360 --> 03:31.440
All demon summoners have the ability to recognize each other.

03:32.020 --> 03:35.000
That is their singular common trait.

03:35.000 --> 03:37.470
They gain this ability through accepting the existence of the paranormal.

03:37.470 --> 03:39.900
That, or it's a supernatural gift bestowed upon us by god...

03:40.870 --> 03:48.330
Or they lack something. Those who lack something as humans attract demons.

03:49.380 --> 03:52.000
That is rather strange.

03:52.000 --> 03:53.290
So they're like, human trash?

03:53.800 --> 03:55.930
Well, he might be like that. But what about other summoners?

03:55.930 --> 03:57.690
Okuto-san or Akutabe-san?

03:57.690 --> 04:00.510
Are you saying I'm rotten?!

04:00.510 --> 04:02.760
I'm normal, right?! RIGHT?!

04:03.850 --> 04:08.890
Do you want me to tell you that you're really kind and gentle? No way!

04:08.890 --> 04:11.730
Don't think you'll get away with bullying me all the time!

04:12.300 --> 04:14.360
I'm not a bully...

04:14.360 --> 04:16.550
Seiya-kun. Say something?

04:16.140 --> 04:19.260
This thing looks super dog!

04:19.260 --> 04:21.070
This isn't funny.

04:21.070 --> 04:22.150
In fact, it's kind of insulting.

04:22.300 --> 04:25.090
And what do you mean, "super dog"? Am I something more than a dog?

04:25.090 --> 04:27.260
Well, not an usual dog for sure, since I'm a demon.

04:28.110 --> 04:30.190
You're a real demon? Cool...

04:30.770 --> 04:34.490
Saying I'm cool kind of makes me blush, but thanks!

04:34.490 --> 04:36.730
I'm Azazel, a demon. Nice to meet you!

04:39.280 --> 04:43.920
I see, so your dream is to become the number-one host?

04:43.920 --> 04:47.130
Yeah, exactly. I don't care about all the shit.

04:47.130 --> 04:49.720
I have the talent, it's easy as hell.

04:49.720 --> 04:51.180
Ha! You don't have a shred of talent, idiot!

04:51.580 --> 04:56.740
He's a complete idiot of a host, and he can see demons. Is this for real?

04:56.740 --> 04:58.640
If I use him correctly, I can

04:58.900 --> 05:02.860
realize the most sacred dream of all men, a harem!

05:03.170 --> 05:07.620
Become number-one, and break up with that woman! Do it, Azazel!

05:07.620 --> 05:08.660
{SIR, YES SIR!}{Brine: I don't think a subtitle is necessary here}

05:09.470 --> 05:11.470
Azazel's special ability is the power of lust.

05:13.040 --> 05:20.180
He can control a person's hormones, and change how that person is perceived.

05:20.180 --> 05:26.090
Or he can increase someone's pheromone excretion rate, thereby making them irresistible.

05:35.350 --> 05:38.980
Take a good look at that. You women are all the same.

05:39.800 --> 05:40.940
They're like rabid dogs...

05:43.230 --> 05:45.150
So, Seiya-kun? How about it?

05:45.150 --> 05:47.380
A demon's powers are pretty awesome, aren't they?

05:47.380 --> 05:50.560
I have a proposition for you.

05:50.560 --> 05:52.310
Shit! This isn't good!

05:52.310 --> 05:53.640
Relax, Seiya-kun.

05:53.640 --> 05:55.660
Would you calm down for a second?!

05:56.450 --> 06:01.630
Here. You can get in touch with me through this. Let's discuss this in greater detail.

06:02.050 --> 06:03.820
Az, we're going home!

06:09.520 --> 06:11.180
Shit! This is total bullshit!

06:11.540 --> 06:13.670
It's been total shit since this morning.

06:13.670 --> 06:18.560
Pull yourself together! I know it was awesome. Let's get back to business.

06:18.910 --> 06:22.880
By the way, what I did to you is only temporary.

06:22.880 --> 06:27.030
When my curse wears off, you'll go back to being a third-rate host.

06:27.810 --> 06:32.450
Relax! If you form a contract with me, you can do this all the time!

06:32.450 --> 06:33.520
Really?

06:33.520 --> 06:34.370
Really.

06:34.370 --> 06:36.390
Really really?

06:36.390 --> 06:37.710
Really really.

06:38.230 --> 06:40.430
Well... There is a bit of a problem, though.

06:40.430 --> 06:45.470
To form a contract with you, we need a grimoire. One that isn't here.

06:45.470 --> 06:50.380
We've got a ton of grimoires here, but we don't have mine.

06:50.660 --> 06:56.530
My current contractor has my grimoire right now. Sakuma.

06:56.530 --> 06:59.350
So you just need to steal it from her.

06:59.580 --> 07:01.420
Wait. So this is no good?

07:01.300 --> 07:03.130
You really are simple, aren't you?

07:01.420 --> 07:03.130
Totally no good?

07:03.130 --> 07:05.620
Like I said, that one won't work.

07:05.620 --> 07:07.930
Get that thing away from me!

07:07.930 --> 07:10.480
If that touches me, I'll...

07:12.180 --> 07:15.680
If a demon touches a grimoire, they end up like this!

07:15.680 --> 07:19.040
That's why I asked <i>you</i> to steal it! Unwind me!

07:18.830 --> 07:20.040
Okay.

07:20.110 --> 07:22.250
Have you understood anything I've said to you?!

07:22.640 --> 07:25.210
If that's settled, let's get started.

07:24.340 --> 07:25.210
Har!

07:27.070 --> 07:29.010
Saku-chan, can I talk to you for a second?

07:31.170 --> 07:32.640
What's with you?

07:32.640 --> 07:35.650
It seems I've caught the flu.

07:36.570 --> 07:39.090
Can you give me some advice?

07:39.090 --> 07:42.040
I don't know if I should go to the hospital.

07:42.040 --> 07:47.850
Could you check the grimoire, and find out if I'm supposed to see a doctor?

07:47.850 --> 07:49.820
Ah, that makes sense. I'll check.

07:50.090 --> 07:51.520
Thanks.

07:53.670 --> 07:58.110
Let's see... Are you sure it's the flu, Azazel-san?

07:59.250 --> 08:00.950
Wait a second! Seiya-san? What are you doing here?!

08:01.430 --> 08:03.830
We duped you, you idiot!

08:04.750 --> 08:06.820
Stop!

08:05.100 --> 08:08.420
Run! Run!

08:09.210 --> 08:11.390
Shit! Those assholes!

08:11.390 --> 08:15.890
This is a really bad time, what with Akutabe-san not being here...

08:17.460 --> 08:20.820
I guess I'll have to ask <i>that.</i>

08:30.280 --> 08:35.990
Beelzebub - Specialty: Divulgence

08:32.490 --> 08:35.990
In trouble again, Sakuma-san?

08:36.120 --> 08:42.000
Not really. It's not my fault Azazel-san tricked me.

08:42.420 --> 08:44.830
NO EXCUSES, you worthless bitch!

08:44.830 --> 08:50.800
Beelzebub being
self-assertive
due to
Akutabe's absence.

08:45.380 --> 08:50.800
You really are hopeless if you need me to solve all of YOUR PROBLEMS!

08:51.450 --> 08:56.260
I never seen someone so worthless, you cunt!

08:57.030 --> 09:01.110
Now, say: "I'm really a worthless piece of shit.

09:01.790 --> 09:07.730
Oh, great ruler of insects, Beelzebub-sama, please save my ass." {not sure if i should have seperated this line and the last. feel free to change it back -RE1}

09:08.320 --> 09:08.880
No...

09:08.880 --> 09:10.560
Well, then I'm not helping you!

09:12.580 --> 09:13.800
I'm really a wo....

09:13.800 --> 09:15.200
I can't hear you!

09:15.780 --> 09:18.450
I'm really a worthless piece o...

09:18.450 --> 09:21.830
You imbecile! Act like you're embarrassed!

09:21.830 --> 09:23.870
I'm really a worthless piece of shit.

09:24.910 --> 09:27.540
But he really crossed the line this time.

09:27.540 --> 09:30.380
This is a pretty bad situation you're in.

09:31.110 --> 09:38.950
If you let go of the grimoire, that indicates a renunciation of the contract.

09:40.000 --> 09:42.430
There are four possible cases.

09:42.430 --> 09:46.560
One, transfer. Two, destruction. Three, theft. Four, loss.

09:46.700 --> 09:52.020
It's especially problematic if you defile the grimoire by the latter three.

09:52.600 --> 09:57.990
You will be punished heavily and never again be able to contract the demon.

09:58.330 --> 10:02.700
It'll be fine, won't it? When Akutabe-san comes back, he'll fix it!

10:03.160 --> 10:08.680
Not possible. No matter what powers Akutabe-san has, he can't fix something like this.

10:08.680 --> 10:10.660
It's an Unbreakable Rule.

10:10.960 --> 10:13.490
I don't want to end up like that!

10:14.190 --> 10:16.590
Beelzebub-san, do something!

10:15.620 --> 10:16.590
Nah!

10:17.350 --> 10:18.160
Wait a minute,

10:19.250 --> 10:24.610
Say I get turned into an animal, wouldn't my contract with you be void?

10:25.310 --> 10:31.610
Yes. In that case, any demonic contracts that you've made would be null and void.

10:32.680 --> 10:40.530
Shit! If I lose her as my contractor, I'm sure to be contracted to Akutabe.

10:40.530 --> 10:42.070
Contracted to that monster!

10:42.400 --> 10:44.540
You thought of a way didn't you?

10:44.540 --> 10:46.740
Please help me Do%@emon!

10:46.740 --> 10:53.630
Demons can't be contracted to a different human within forty-eight hours of their last voided contract.

10:53.630 --> 10:56.550
That means that if you get it back within that time, all will be well.

10:57.240 --> 10:58.670
I'll definitely find that scumbag!

10:59.050 --> 11:00.400
Unforgivable!

11:01.100 --> 11:05.970
Ditching me, and trying to escape from Akutabe-san alone? Such actions can not be forgiven!

11:05.970 --> 11:08.140
You shitty demon dog asshole!

11:08.830 --> 11:10.100
Seiya?

11:10.360 --> 11:12.300
He quit already.

11:12.300 --> 11:14.100
Do you know where he went?

11:14.100 --> 11:16.570
Even if I did, I wouldn't tell you! Idiot!

11:16.750 --> 11:17.850
Tell me!

11:18.650 --> 11:21.450
Beelzebub's special ability is the power of "Bakuro".{Divulgence}

11:22.600 --> 11:26.990
Seiya went to the five-star host club. It's highly esteemed, and in the top circles of society.

11:26.990 --> 11:34.420
And now he thinks he's the greatest host ever, and that he gets to do all the hottest...

11:37.410 --> 11:40.340
I want to drink something expensive...

11:40.650 --> 11:42.390
Bring us Don Peri!

11:42.390 --> 11:43.950
Then I want Don Peri Gold!

11:44.150 --> 11:45.860
Then I want Don Peri Platinum!

11:45.860 --> 11:47.270
Then I want Don Peri Diamond!

11:47.270 --> 11:48.250
Then I want Don Peri Extreme!

11:53.100 --> 11:56.950
Atta boy, Seiya. I would expect nothing less from my contractor.

11:57.350 --> 12:02.250
But it's not enough! For now, let's fuck every woman in Tokyo!

12:03.680 --> 12:06.010
And then, all the women in Japan-

12:06.010 --> 12:13.580
No, the WORLD will bow to me! And then I shall create the Azazel Empire, and put even the Romans to shame!

12:14.560 --> 12:17.850
So you've come, four-eyed shithead.

12:17.850 --> 12:19.550
Do your worst!

12:20.580 --> 12:22.760
Hey, are you even trying?

12:23.170 --> 12:25.870
Seiya-san, please come to this table.

12:25.870 --> 12:27.330
Hi, I'm Seiya.

12:27.330 --> 12:30.350
Making me wait this time, huh?

12:30.800 --> 12:32.980
Hand over the grimoire! NOW!

12:33.480 --> 12:34.650
I don't...

12:34.650 --> 12:37.920
Don't try to play dumb! Sit! Take a seat!

12:38.200 --> 12:42.800
Look, Azazel has tricked you.  You <i>are</i> a moron, after all.

12:42.800 --> 12:46.310
Morons and grimoires don't mix well.

12:46.310 --> 12:47.910
Take a look!

12:49.820 --> 12:52.150
Hey, you pulled a chameleon out of your bag!

12:52.150 --> 12:54.120
You're like Houdini!

12:54.440 --> 12:55.080
Shutup!

12:55.960 --> 12:57.060
Okay...

12:57.330 --> 13:01.370
See, at one point this chameleon was a human.

13:01.370 --> 13:07.970
And like you, he got involved with a demon. In the end, this is what he turned into.

13:08.170 --> 13:10.460
Anyway, is that a penguin you have there?!

13:11.590 --> 13:16.350
Come here, penguin! Come to papa!

13:16.880 --> 13:17.770
Focus, you retarded baboon!

13:18.790 --> 13:19.770
Okay...

13:20.020 --> 13:22.680
Ah, well. It's no use trying to talk to an idiot.

13:23.240 --> 13:24.740
Give me back my grimoire, right now!

13:25.560 --> 13:26.060
Get lost.

13:28.330 --> 13:31.200
Talk! Where'd you stash the grimoire?!

13:31.620 --> 13:32.580
I have it here!

13:33.030 --> 13:39.640
It makes me look so sexy! I'm so super sexy!

13:39.640 --> 13:41.220
Give it back, you moron!

13:41.220 --> 13:44.550
Stop! Give it back you idiot!

13:47.410 --> 13:48.930
Leave it at that, please.

13:50.170 --> 13:52.890
I like spirited women.

13:53.140 --> 13:55.850
These two could kill a grizzly bear with their bare hands.

13:55.850 --> 13:58.810
Or strangle an elephant, if I asked them to.

13:59.020 --> 14:02.270
They're the strongest zookeepers in the world!

14:02.640 --> 14:06.550
You! Scum! You know what they say about strength, right?

14:06.550 --> 14:07.170
Eh?

14:07.170 --> 14:08.510
Don't "Eh?" me.

14:08.510 --> 14:10.240
You should watch what you say to me.

14:11.190 --> 14:12.340
Strength is

14:13.270 --> 14:13.950
women!

14:15.430 --> 14:17.820
My power is the strongest in Japan!

14:18.530 --> 14:19.920
The power of the Emperor!

14:20.230 --> 14:22.000
I wonder about that.

14:22.000 --> 14:22.630
WHAT?!

14:25.470 --> 14:28.050
What's wrong with you, sister?!

14:30.360 --> 14:34.840
There is no living creature that can stand against my powers.

14:34.840 --> 14:38.910
I am the strongest!

14:50.330 --> 14:51.340
We're doomed!                            {check 14:53}

14:51.700 --> 14:57.400
Saku-chan, have mercy! I only did this because I love you so much!

14:57.400 --> 15:00.290
I've realized that there is no better woman than you!

15:00.290 --> 15:05.500
So I mean, don't be mad! Please spare me! Please say you forgive me...

15:13.110 --> 15:14.730
What the hell? Is she sleeping?

15:15.420 --> 15:16.390
I believe so!

15:18.000 --> 15:19.350
Complete Victory
of Emperor Azazel

15:26.420 --> 15:29.560
You think this is an appropriate time for a nap?!

15:29.560 --> 15:32.040
What are you doing?! That hurts, you know!

15:31.550 --> 15:34.510
Of course it does! That's the point, you shithead!

15:34.510 --> 15:36.660
How did you manage to fall asleep at such a critical moment?!

15:36.660 --> 15:39.660
I do that when I drink too much.

15:39.660 --> 15:41.750
Then pace yourself, you idiot!

15:42.040 --> 15:43.630
Quiet your voices.

15:44.250 --> 15:45.960
You're in my presence!

15:46.230 --> 15:48.530
Hear me out, Azazel-kun!

15:48.530 --> 15:50.420
I'm at the end of my rope here, too!

15:50.890 --> 15:54.670
This idiot should have my grimoire on her,

15:54.670 --> 15:58.610
let that guy contract me instead of her, too!

15:58.610 --> 16:02.680
I, Beelzebub, shall be of great value to the Azazel Empire!

16:03.250 --> 16:04.150
Seiya!

16:04.570 --> 16:05.920
Commence the torture!

16:08.400 --> 16:13.570
Do not fret! I have sent your grimoire to the Akutabe agency!

16:15.130 --> 16:16.950
With payment on delivery, of course.

16:17.240 --> 16:18.780
Why would you do that?!

16:18.780 --> 16:20.950
I'd rather die than contract Akutabe!

16:20.950 --> 16:25.910
Please at least let me die in peace, Azazel-kun!

16:26.350 --> 16:27.900
I do as I please.

16:29.050 --> 16:33.840
And you address royalty now! Refer to me as Kaizer!

16:34.300 --> 16:36.150
You're getting full of yourself again.

16:36.150 --> 16:36.800
What did you say?

16:37.140 --> 16:42.770
You think you've avoided Akutabe-san's wrath, don't you?

16:42.890 --> 16:46.950
I fear nothing! KAIZER FEARS NO ONE!

16:56.760 --> 16:57.900
Holy shit that was scary.

16:57.900 --> 16:58.860
No shit...

16:58.860 --> 17:01.650
That guy looked exactly like him.

17:01.650 --> 17:05.250
You were scared shitless, and that guy looked nothing like Akutabe.

17:05.360 --> 17:08.830
Shut up! It seems I'm leaking from all this excitement.

17:08.830 --> 17:10.080
Don't leak on me, you idiot!

17:10.080 --> 17:11.670
I wasn't scared at all!

17:12.270 --> 17:14.320
Kaizer, the preparations are complete.

17:14.320 --> 17:15.510
I will be there shortly.

17:15.950 --> 17:22.290
I plan to throw them off the edge of the world. Until then, watch over them.

17:22.940 --> 17:23.980
Understood!

17:24.430 --> 17:28.940
By the way, during that time Akutabe-san was on the other side of the planet.

17:31.410 --> 17:36.120
It's almost time! My contract with Sakuma is about to expire!

17:36.120 --> 17:38.910
We'll be able to write up our contract soon.

17:38.910 --> 17:41.960
We shall usher in the dawn of a new era! Right, Seiya?

17:41.960 --> 17:43.760
Yeah we will.

17:43.760 --> 17:47.830
By the way, what's a contract Zel-san?

17:47.830 --> 17:50.810
After all this, you still don't know?

17:50.810 --> 17:52.710
I thought I explained it to you already.

17:52.710 --> 17:55.820
Basically, it'll make you popular!

17:55.820 --> 17:56.380
You get it?

17:56.380 --> 17:58.840
Really?! Really Really?!

17:59.040 --> 18:00.800
Yes, really really...

18:01.400 --> 18:04.050
Is it just me, or is he getting dumber by the minute?

18:04.050 --> 18:05.770
But I guess this idiot is useful.

18:06.270 --> 18:07.860
My bowels....

18:07.860 --> 18:12.690
That shitty fly. Some of his curse has yet to dissipate, it seems.

18:13.560 --> 18:16.660
Oh shit, I need to shit.

18:16.820 --> 18:19.080
Zel-san how about you? Let's go together!

18:19.080 --> 18:21.930
Why do I need to shit with you?!

18:21.930 --> 18:23.120
Let's go!

18:22.860 --> 18:23.980
Unhand me! I don't want to!

18:24.640 --> 18:28.460
What's wrong with you people? This is the men's restroom, you know!

18:30.840 --> 18:32.420
Seiya!!!

18:37.830 --> 18:41.260
Holy shit! There's no toilet paper!

18:41.260 --> 18:43.640
You people used too much!

18:43.640 --> 18:47.770
Oh, I have some. This'll have to do.

18:49.950 --> 18:51.660
What is this strange feeling?

18:51.660 --> 18:57.240
There is a disturbance in the force... Is my dad okay?

18:57.530 --> 18:59.700
Holy... That was unreal.

19:00.350 --> 19:03.080
There was no paper in the bathroom.

19:03.080 --> 19:04.640
So?

19:04.640 --> 19:08.060
Paper, you know? It was there, but it was all gone.

19:08.060 --> 19:10.000
Make up your mind! Was there paper or not?!

19:10.000 --> 19:11.060
There wasn't.

19:11.060 --> 19:13.890
You did wipe your ass, right?

19:13.600 --> 19:15.670
Zel-san that's mean!

19:16.100 --> 19:18.130
I used the paper I had with me!

19:20.170 --> 19:21.090
What could you possibly mean by that?

19:21.330 --> 19:25.800
Seiya, explain this to me please. When you went to the bathroom, did you use my grimoire as...

19:25.800 --> 19:27.810
WHAT DID YOU DO TO MY GRIMOIRE?!

19:28.300 --> 19:31.020
I tore a page to wipe it, and then to make sure it was clean I tore another.

19:32.310 --> 19:33.450
What did you do....

19:34.070 --> 19:35.720
WHAT THE HELL HAVE YOU DONE?!

19:35.720 --> 19:39.280
WHY DID YOU USE MY GRIMOIRE INSTEAD OF A HANDKERCHIEF OR SOMETHING?!

19:39.280 --> 19:41.840
Oh, my bad. I didn't think of that.

19:41.840 --> 19:45.970
Bad?! You have no idea! This is really, really bad!

19:45.970 --> 19:47.410
Do you have any idea how bad this is?!

20:00.510 --> 20:03.680
Hey, Zel-san became really big!

20:04.040 --> 20:07.990
How dumb can you be?! Can you even understand that you became a mantis?

20:07.990 --> 20:11.090
A mantis? What the hell is a mantis?

20:11.090 --> 20:13.110
You don't even know what a mantis is?!

20:13.110 --> 20:15.980
You know, it's an insect that eats crops!

20:17.320 --> 20:18.040
Seiya...

20:19.900 --> 20:20.400
Hey...

20:23.890 --> 20:25.590
Say something...

20:26.860 --> 20:30.180
The jig is up, I guess. I can hardly believe it.

20:30.990 --> 20:32.430
Such a pitiful ending.

20:33.550 --> 20:36.440
I don't have time to worry about the others!

20:36.440 --> 20:38.430
I need to do something about the grimoire!

20:38.430 --> 20:42.290
Hey babe, could you please get that book for me?

20:42.290 --> 20:43.750
You want me to do what, you pig?

20:44.030 --> 20:44.830
This is bad.

20:45.830 --> 20:50.240
Without Seiya around, everybody's gone back to their usual selves.

20:50.240 --> 20:51.220
What's going to happen to me...?

20:51.910 --> 20:53.670
Anyway, I'm going home.

20:53.670 --> 20:54.260
Me too.

20:54.140 --> 20:54.730
Me too.

20:54.580 --> 20:55.200
Me too.

20:54.730 --> 20:55.200
Me too.

20:55.730 --> 20:59.150
Please wait! Someone, please pick up that book for me! Please!

21:00.020 --> 21:03.150
If you do, you'll have a rose-colored life!

21:03.150 --> 21:03.760
That dog is really annoying.

21:03.760 --> 21:07.130
If you sign a contract with me, you'll be super popular!

21:07.530 --> 21:08.300
Really?!

21:08.300 --> 21:10.970
Really really! Thanks, sis...

21:14.070 --> 21:16.240
Is something the matter, Azazel-kun?

21:16.240 --> 21:18.460
You're sweating rather profusely there.

21:18.880 --> 21:21.160
If you have any excuses, now would be the appropriate time to give them.

21:22.340 --> 21:23.160
Now then...

21:23.960 --> 21:27.260
Oh, I'm REALLY sorry!

21:27.700 --> 21:29.650
You don't really have to apologize.

21:31.940 --> 21:35.190
I'll take it, do your worst!

21:35.320 --> 21:39.400
Do whatever it takes to satisfy your lust for revenge!

21:40.800 --> 21:48.260
Bah, Sakuma's punishment could never even come close to what Akutabe would do to me!

21:48.260 --> 21:53.950
I just need to bear it until that idiot is satisfied. I can take a little pain.

22:08.940 --> 22:10.960
Say, isn't that incantation a bit long?

22:11.890 --> 22:12.720
Aren't you about done?

22:40.040 --> 22:46.430
No matter if she is a disgrace as a human or as a detective, Beelzebub has just witnessed how,

22:46.430 --> 22:52.550
under Akutabe's tutelage, his protégé has matured as demon summoner.{timer fix this shit}

22:53.310 --> 22:54.800
Well then, let's go home.

23:00.440 --> 23:02.390
It hurts...

23:02.390 --> 23:03.980
My head hurts like hell!

23:04.250 --> 23:09.130
No shit. After casting something like that, it'd have to! Idiot!

23:09.130 --> 23:14.200
It's all about willpower. This just means that was your limit!

23:20.130 --> 23:22.440
The torn pages are back.

23:23.080 --> 23:25.000
This is one mysterious book.

23:25.650 --> 23:27.880
I'll have to watch out for it from now on.

23:29.140 --> 23:33.540
I've been thinking that I should report everything to Akutabe-san when he gets back.

23:34.710 --> 23:38.690
Don't do that! He'll be mad for sure! 100% chance that he'll be furious!

23:38.690 --> 23:41.230
You shouldn't tell him! Right, Bee?

23:41.580 --> 23:43.370
No! We should report everything!

23:43.370 --> 23:43.980
You traitor!

23:44.480 --> 23:47.850
How dirty and foolish Azazel-kun's betrayal was.

23:48.600 --> 23:55.950
And how I, Beelzebub, risked my life on a blood-soaked battlefield to bring you back.

23:56.550 --> 23:59.800
I'll report what you said too, Beelzebub-san.

23:59.800 --> 24:01.940
YOU TRIED TO BACKSTAB ME, TOO!

24:01.940 --> 24:05.510
PLEASE, NOOOO!
